  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Men and Boys  for Gender Equality (MBGE) Empowering communities</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Men and Boys for Gender Equality (MBGE) Empowering Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MBGE is an organisation that promotes Gender justice through transformative interventions that engages men and Boys in ending gender based violence, advancing womens rights and fostering healthy masculinities. The project aims to address the root cause of GBV and enhancing community level prevention and response mechanisms. The project  aims to  reach key gatekeepers such as dikgosi, customary court   officials and service providers with targeted training. Ther support will also  strenghten CSO roles in rural advocacy.</narrative>
